== Description ==

'''Plant Fiber''' is a raw material in ''[[Human Host]]'', harvested from the world (trees, rocks, salvage). It appears as an ingredient in 1 downstream recipes at the [[Carpentry Workbench]], including [[Log Stair]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

